{"id":"vod_md_4719","vodId":"4719","provider":"md","providerName":"魔都动漫","type":2,"name":"刀剑神域 爱丽丝篇","name_cn":"刀剑神域 爱丽丝篇","date":"2018-01-01","year":"2018","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"24集全","images":{"common":"https://www.mdzypic.com/upload/vod/20230911-1/f3bd1781251dda1c373d872a96783568.jpg"},"summary":"“这里……是哪儿……”察觉到的时候，桐人不知为什么陷入了庞大的幻想风格虚拟世界。登录前的记忆模糊不清，只得在周围徘徊寻找线索。之后，来到漆黑的巨树“基家斯西达”旁边的他，同一名少年相遇了。“我的名字是尤吉欧。请多关照，桐人君。”少年是在虚拟世界的居民――即“NPC”，但是却如同人类一样拥有“丰富感情”。在和尤吉欧加深交往的同时，桐人也在摸索着登出这个世界的方法。在桐人的脑海中，某一个记忆苏醒了。那是幼年时的桐人和尤吉欧在山野奔跑的记忆――原本，不可能存在的记忆。而在那个回忆中，除了尤吉欧还有一个金发少女的身影。她的名字，是爱丽丝。绝对不应该忘记的、重要的名字。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-09-11 08:26:55","playable":true,"episodeCount":25,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"modum3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第1集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230910/zTM7IFTT/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第2集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230910/YNOtmuLG/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第3集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230910/vhc9N7Yp/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第4集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230910/5n6QlUDf/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第5集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230910/K7Ei9w0o/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第6集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230910/8CMWIaHR/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第7集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230910/nNBp4VMD/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第8集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230910/YSaQkNy0/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第9集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230910/TjH1TUSa/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230910/3JGsqLGc/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230910/nI0JdE0T/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230910/4O184UVS/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230910/2gdgwcI1/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第14集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230910/qArwKiXD/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第15集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230910/ABIkuqmr/index.m3u8"},{"na